  "scope": "Local macOS arm64 owned SDK native offer/answer and exact client confirmation, mixed audio/video/data parameter selection, current Connection metadata and original-ID recovery. No decoded media or media I/O, complete SDK/external crate/package/remote/Linux/performance or acceptance qualification.",
  "implemented_operation_kinds": 14,
  "implementation": [
    "Public Session.offer_connection accepts typed Connection/Stream IDs, Medium, Direction and ordered codec preferences with an application-saved operation ID. A verified initial signed native answer returns an observable Operation before the separate server parameter offer must settle.",
    "Native confirmation checks all original roots, initial request ID, native setup kind/revision, selected stream IDs/kinds/codecs/directions, unique RTP hop handles, exact answered setup and capability continuity. Local confirmation reverses server directions and signs a fresh same-root answer without a copied revision/signature.",
    "One shared SDK driver owns both phases and concurrent control. No final native ACK is fabricated. Operation.wait queries the distinct durable result. Late local cancellation retains the native exchange until confirmation/deadline/peer retirement; no automatic replay.",
    "64 owned native Connection metadata entries bound this peer; a native offer counts against the existing16 queued/active exchange bound until confirmation. Hop-handle collisions and existing physical binding replacement refuse before signing.",
    "Offer builder currently declares PCMU/PCMA/mono Opus, VP8 video/screen and reliable ordered text/JSON/binary parameters. Original ordered preferences remain in the signed intent, including unsupported candidates before a supported fallback. Unsupported-only streams and separate transition markers refuse before submission.",
    "Connection.refresh shares the bounded current-authorized snapshot reader and exposes typed native resource metadata. ConnectionRevision is independent of StreamRevision. The journal has no negotiated stream counter, so fresh stream_revision is None; original receipt counter and local signed negotiation parameters are separate observations.",
    "Status-only restored Connection handles do not inherit another peer's hop-local native binding. Locally signed parameters never establish media readiness, remote consumption or current permission."
  ],
